 "budgets": {
  "about": "The size budget per section that tools/budget_check.mjs checks (proposed by the engine round, 2026-10-12, from S6 inner_city, S5 gate and S4 outer_road part 1 as shipped with KTX2 textures, plus headroom). A new section must PASS before it joins the world. The page holds three sections at once (yours and each neighbour, web/src/world.js), so the window budget is what a phone holds: about 200 MB of sections, plus the fixed render targets (about 60 MB on a phone at the 1.5 pixel-ratio cap), plus 100-150 MB of JS, well under the 1-1.5 GB at which an iPhone Safari tab dies. Measured on the desktop GPU, where ETC1S copies become BC7 (8 bits a pixel; a phone gets ETC1, 4); the texture MB estimates use the phone's formats.",
